{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Field trip gone WRONG?\u00a0</strong>Stumbled into a spine-tingling forest where mythic beasts lurk?   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Herb-hunting disaster?</strong> Now you\u2019re face-to-face with a <strong>giant crimson legendary monster</strong>?   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the academy\u2019s <strong>rising pharmacy star</strong>, you\u2019re destined to triumph\u2026 until\u2014  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u201cWait\u2014where\u2019s my herb pouch? How do I even mix potions now\uff1fWhy can't I remember anything??!\u201d  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>POOF!</strong> Your genius? Gone. All that\u2019s left? Panic and a sword-crazy warrior buddy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this demo, how does a &quot;genius&quot; pharmacist who has just lost her knowledge deal with a sudden challenge? There will be more battles and potion combinations in the official version, so stay tuned!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452510/extras/\u63a8\u7406-en.png?t=1742896239\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine the materials obtained on the adventure, and based on the reactions of your partner and enemies after drinking the potion, figure out the effects of the herbs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452510/extras/\u642d\u6863\u559d\u836f12.83mb.gif?t=1742896239\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452510/extras/\u6218\u6597en.png?t=1742896239\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Under the attack of various strange monsters one after another, find a breakthrough, formulate a drug strategy, and take it down in one fell swoop!<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452510/extras/\u706b\u9f99\u55b7\u706b.gif?t=1742896239\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452510/extras/\u53ef\u7231-en.png?t=1742896239\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Paper-style scenes and characters to create a children's picture book-like fairy tale!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452510/extras/\u62d4.gif?t=1742896239\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3452510?t=1742896239","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3452510?t=1742896239","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452510/4236effec4413793345c3bcb4f4c36e382473689/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742896239","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452510/4236effec4413793345c3bcb4f4c36e382473689/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742896239","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Field trip gone WRONG?\u00a0</strong>Stumbled into a spine-tingling forest where mythic beasts lurk?   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Herb-hunting disaster?</strong> Now you\u2019re face-to-face with a <strong>giant crimson legendary monster</strong>?   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the academy\u2019s <strong>rising pharmacy star</strong>, you\u2019re destined to triumph\u2026 until\u2014  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u201cWait\u2014where\u2019s my herb pouch? How do I even mix potions now\uff1fWhy can't I remember anything??!\u201d  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>POOF!</strong> Your genius? Gone. All that\u2019s left? Panic and a sword-crazy warrior buddy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this demo, how does a &quot;genius&quot; pharmacist who has just lost her knowledge deal with a sudden challenge? There will be more battles and potion combinations in the official version, so stay tuned!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452510/extras/\u63a8\u7406-en.png?t=1742896239\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine the materials obtained on the adventure, and based on the reactions of your partner and enemies after drinking the potion, figure out the effects of the herbs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452510/extras/\u642d\u6863\u559d\u836f12.83mb.gif?t=1742896239\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452510/extras/\u6218\u6597en.png?t=1742896239\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Under the attack of various strange monsters one after another, find a breakthrough, formulate a drug strategy, and take it down in one fell swoop!<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452510/extras/\u706b\u9f99\u55b7\u706b.gif?t=1742896239\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452510/extras/\u53ef\u7231-en.png?t=1742896239\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Paper-style scenes and characters to create a children's picture book-like fairy tale!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452510/extras/\u62d4.gif?t=1742896239\" /></p>","developers":["Random Tun"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3371070","name":"Are you sure to drink?"},"genres"